{"parent":"page.sustainability.json","context":{"market":"gb"},"sections":{"slideshow_9KNjXc":{"disabled":true,"settings":{"transition_type":"fade"},"blocks":{}},"rich_text_zMPGG9":{"settings":{"content":"<p>We take helping in looking after our planet seriously at William Wood. For every order placed, we pledge the following actions.<\/p><p><\/p><p>1. We plant one tree in partnership with ecodrive<\/p><p>2. We offset all of our carbon emissions produced from shipping in partnership with Shopify Planet<\/p><p>3. We donate a proportion of our monthly revenue to preventing plastic from reaching our oceans in partnership with CleanHub<\/p>"},"blocks":{}},"rich_text_6dJDQY":{"settings":{"content":"<p>In addition, we use 100% Sustainably Sourced Paulownia Wood for almost all of our wooden framed mirrors.<\/p>"},"blocks":{}},"rich_text_Q39iYy":{"settings":{"content":"<p>Through our partnership with Shopify Planet, we ensure every single delivery that we make is Carbon-neutral.<\/p>"},"blocks":{}},"rich_text_TYaimK":{"settings":{"content":"<p>Every time you order, we plant a tree - we also give you the option to double-up and plant your own tree via a voluntary donation of just £0.45.<\/p>"},"blocks":{}},"rich_text_4ByNDQ":{"settings":{"subheading":"Driving Sustainable Innovation","content":"<p>We are always looking at new ways to improve our positive impact on the planet, from optimising delivery routes to reduce our carbon emissions, encouraging frequent recycling and using eco-friendly packaging options.<\/p><p><\/p><p>If you have any suggestions on how we can improve our sustainability strategy, please reach out to us with your suggestion via <a href=\"mailto:hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk\">hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk<\/a><\/p>","button_text":"DISCOVER OUR BEST SELLERS"},"blocks":{}},"coll_slideshow_Ywmqn":{"type":"coll-slideshow","disabled":false,"settings":{"section_height":"auto","transition_type":